source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Recorded incident bundles: export, integrity-verified replay, counterfactual (not live re-execution)

Usage: franken-node incident <COMMAND>

Commands:
  bundle          Export deterministic incident bundle
  replay          Integrity-verified replay of the recorded incident bundle (not live re-execution)
  counterfactual  Simulate alternative policy actions
  list            List recorded incidents
  capture         Capture a recorded run as incident evidence from its persisted, signed host-effect ledger (re-verified before anything is written)
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
